The scene is classified as a **StateAnomaly** because the primary issue stems from the current state of the road (wet and reflective) and weather conditions (nighttime and rain), rather than any anomalous behavior or evidence-based indicators. The ontology does not include a direct class for "wet road," so it is modeled as a **RoadObject** with a description. The risks identified are **RoadConditionRisk**, **OcclusionRisk**, and **CollisionRisk**, reflecting the primary hazards in this scenario.